          ":question/problem": "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}?$",
          ":question/worked-solution": "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{3}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ -{x}_{1} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2{x}_{2} \\\\ 3{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{3} \\\\ -3{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} \\\\ -{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2}+{x}_{3} \\\\ -{x}_{2}-3{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} &=1 \\\\ -{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2}+{x}_{3} &=0 \\\\ -{x}_{2}-3{x}_{3} &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -3 & 1\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+{R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -3 & 1\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+{R}_{2} \\\\  & \u223c\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} &=1 \\\\ {x}_{2}+3{x}_{3} &=1 \\\\ 0 &=2.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\n \n\nHowever, the final equation $0=2$  gives a false statement. So the system has no solution."
        },
